			title: "Waystone on the Moon"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E510A95C066D14C"]
			description: [
				"Combustion generators, gas turbines and boilers only burn where there is air: Earth, the Nether, the End and the building worlds. Up here they sit idle, and EMI lists the worlds each fuel burns in."
				"Fuels that carry their own oxygen burn anywhere: methalox and rocket fuels. Steam turbines burn nothing and work everywhere."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:flint_and_steel"
			id: "16E2B1FFE70AC165"
			rewards: [{ id: "31B61BB841330806", type: "xp", xp: 20 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "36E0705B646B27B6", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Vacuum: Nothing Burns"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E510A95C066D14C"]
			description: ["Raw ilmenite and raw olivine from a lunar vein make one sample; the two kinds of regolith, scooped up, make the other. Each needs an empty vein probe from Earth."]
			icon: "grindless:vein_sample_ilmenite_moon"
