			title: "Lunar Samples"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["65FD970F8628E474"]
			description: [
				"Craft the &6Lunar Drill&r on Earth and build it here: it forms anywhere but only drills on the Moon."
				"A sample and a stainless steel bit go in the input bus. Until the bridge to Earth is up, it runs on the batteries you brought."
