		}
		{
			dependencies: ["246C8ADBADA728E9", "53D1CE971F63D842"]
			description: ["The Moon's ilmenite is the only titanium in the pack. At home the EBF turns it into rutile, chlorine and carbon make titanium tetrachloride, magnesium reduces that in the EBF, and the vacuum freezer cools the hot ingot."]
			icon: "gtceu:titanium_ingot"
