		{
			dependencies: ["164F0808EF9DF557", "70F4075BAF69DA99"]
			description: ["GTM's own &6Distillation Tower&r takes over crude oil in EV, and right now it splits liquid air into oxygen, nitrogen and the noble gases the refinery never touched."]
