		{
			dependencies: ["1DC956E9F071636A"]
			description: [
				"An ender pearl and helium-3 react into a &6Lunar Quantum Seed&r on the Moon; thrown into an explosion with an AE2 singularity, it gives an entangled pair."
				"One goes in a quantum chamber at home, the other in one here, and both ends need chunk-loading. A pair made on Earth is pushed out of a lunar chamber."
