		{
			dependencies: ["366AB48E5BF50431"]
			description: [
				"Two &6EU P2P Tunnels&r on one frequency: one against a cable at home, the other against the drill's energy hatch. The home power plant now runs the Moon."
				"A pair carries a full sixteen-amp EV line. AE2 takes a small toll in AE energy for everything it moves, so give the home network's acceptors some headroom."
			]
			icon: "eup2p:eu_p2p_tunnel"
			id: "42BF2F77456F8773"
