			title: "Power from Earth"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["366AB48E5BF50431"]
			description: ["The bridge carries a limited number of channels. An &6ME P2P Tunnel&r pair across it spends one and carries a whole cable's worth: a couple of pairs give the Moon base the full network of home."]
