		{
			dependencies: ["246C8ADBADA728E9"]
			description: [
				"Lunar stone, cobblestone and sand from the drill grind into &6Lunar Regolith Dust&r in any macerator. An electric furnace bakes it into &6Sintered Regolith Bricks&r, but only on the Moon: at home it sits idle."
				"Every structure of the Moon base stands on these bricks."
