		{
			dependencies: ["33EFC07080657F50", "164F0808EF9DF557"]
			description: [
				"Oxygen on a world with no air, titanium without chlorine and bricks for the rest of the base. The &6Regolith Cell&r is a hall of sintered brick around a crucible ringed with nichrome coils, and its recipes only run up here."
				"Its anode is a platinum electrode in the input bus. Circuit 3 bakes bricks four at a time, at the furnace's energy per brick."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:regolith_cell"
			id: "5BEACE3F7A414F40"
			rewards: [
