			title: "Titanium without Chlorine"
			x: 18.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5BEACE3F7A414F40"]
			description: [
				"A field of wing panels on titanium posts over sintered brick, radiators behind. Put programmed circuit 1 in the &6Lunar Solar Array&r's input bus and every panel that sees open sky feeds the base by day."
				"At night it rests: buffers, or Earth over the bridge, carry the base until dawn."
			]
