			title: "Lunar Solar Array"
			x: 16.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F20597E41D764DE"]
			description: [
				"Aluminium heat pipes full of ammonia make the &6Night-Sky Radiator&r. The &6Cryogenic Plant&r is a frostproof tower on sintered brick with a wing of radiators on each side, and nothing may cover them."
				"It only works on the Moon, and at night it costs half the vacuum freezer's energy: it pours its heat into a black sky."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:cryogenic_plant"
