			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["79EE0C54F2D89358"]
			description: [
				"GregTech never liquefied nitrogen; the cryogenic plant does, from the cell's nitrogen or from home. Pipes and tanks have to handle cryogenic fluids: check the tooltip."
				"In the tripod's input hatch it keeps the bit cold: half again as much ore and a quarter of the wear. With less than one bore's worth in the hatch, the tripod drills dry."
			]
