			title: "Colder than the Lunar Night"
			x: 18.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["79EE0C54F2D89358"]
			description: [
				"Oxygen from the cell becomes liquid oxygen at the freezer's speed and, after sunset, at half its energy. The controller shows what the next run costs."
