		{
			dependencies: ["734B97375A3121C4"]
			description: [
				"No sky, no soil, no air. Bring the soil, make the sky out of lamps and let the plants make the air: the &6Sealed Dome&r grows crops on the Moon and Mars from water and carbon dioxide, and breathes out oxygen."
				"Programmed circuit 4 grows the off-world crops. On Mars it takes the carbon dioxide from the air; up here it comes from home."
