		{
			dependencies: ["5B5C54F1B2AE9B99"]
			description: [
				"The Lunar Drill was a visitor; the &6EV Tripod Drill&r stays. Titanium legs on brick footings, a raised body, a drill string between them and two wings of solar panels. It is crafted from the old Lunar Drill and drills only the Moon's and Mars's veins."
