		{
			dependencies: ["5A84C7A4F1A7F2D9"]
			description: [
				"Thin carbon dioxide air, low gravity and deep cold: the HV suit is enough. Bring a waystone, because the way home is through it, not the rocket."
				"Pack the kit: brick footings, the bridge parts, a chemical reactor with ender pearls and helium-3, and charged batteries. Sunlight is weak here: the solar array wants circuit 2 and gives under a third."
